{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Routine</strong> is a physics-based, goofy simulation of a typical day-to-day life in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the members of a space family going through their daily routines like jetpacking to work, attending school, engaging in leisure activities, buying groceries, repairing or changing the car, and spending some quality family time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers an original take on the life simulation genre, incorporating goofy physics mechanics into the gameplay and featuring a funny retro style with plenty of pop culture references that will resonate strongly with the player's inner child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Routine</strong> presents a sci-fi perspective on daily life, encouraging players to reflect on their own day-to-day routines and family life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based space life simulator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend to your family's needs: health, food, job, entertainment, and love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random starting locations for your family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames to make your daily office job easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different space cars for buzzing around in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundance of space stations, homes, offices, stores, and space food carts! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1194730?t=1766177849","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194730/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766177849","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194730/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766177849","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194730/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766177849","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Routine</strong> is a physics-based, goofy simulation of a typical day-to-day life in space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player controls the members of a space family going through their daily routines like jetpacking to work, attending school, engaging in leisure activities, buying groceries, repairing or changing the car, and spending some quality family time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers an original take on the life simulation genre, incorporating goofy physics mechanics into the gameplay and featuring a funny retro style with plenty of pop culture references that will resonate strongly with the player's inner child.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Routine</strong> presents a sci-fi perspective on daily life, encouraging players to reflect on their own day-to-day routines and family life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based space life simulator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attend to your family's needs: health, food, job, entertainment, and love.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random starting locations for your family.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minigames to make your daily office job easier.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different space cars for buzzing around in space.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abundance of space stations, homes, offices, stores, and space food carts! </p></li></ul>","developers":["MeNic Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194730/header.jpg?t=1766177849","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1194730/259312/df55d66a6439d36fcce50b35c869c2fd080191b4/1751202145/dash_av1.mpd?t=1583514092","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1194730/259312/df55d66a6439d36fcce50b35c869c2fd080191b4/1751202145/dash_h264.mpd?t=1583514092","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1194730/259312/df55d66a6439d36fcce50b35c869c2fd080191b4/1751202145/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1583514092","id":256771101,"name":"Space Routine Teaser Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256771101/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1583514092"}],"name":"Space Routine","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (32-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 8800 GT / AMD HD 6850 / Intel HD Graphics 4400 or above<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["MeNic Games"],"ratings":null,"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1194730/ss_f3416d6b889bc1f70b28ad7a40b423a490234675.1920x1080.jpg?t=1766177849","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_